{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00437","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 登歌 · 武则天","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 登歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼崇宗祀，志表严禋。\n笙镛合奏，文物维新。\n敬遵茂典，敢择良辰。\n絜诚斯着，奠谒方申。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}